@startuml
title LR3 — Inheritance and polymorphic map interactions
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

abstract class MapObject {
  +gridPosition : Vector2Int
  {abstract} +Interact(hero : HeroController) : void
}
abstract class TeamOwnedObject {
  +teamId : int
}
class ResourceObject {
  +amount : int
  +IsCollected : bool {readOnly}
  +Interact(hero : HeroController) : void <<override>>
}
class NeutralArmy {
  +Interact(hero : HeroController) : void <<override>>
}
class Castle {
  +entrance : GridStat
  +Interact(hero : HeroController) : void <<override>>
}
class Mine {
  +Interact(hero : HeroController) : void <<override>>
}
class HeroController {
  +teamId : int
  +stats : HeroStats
  +inventory : HeroInventory
  +army : HeroArmy
  -MoveAlongPath() : void
}
class Team {
  +id : int
  +heroes : List<HeroController>
  +castles : List<Castle>
  +mines : List<Mine>
  +gold : int
}
class TeamManager {
  {static} +Instance : TeamManager
  {static} +EnsureExists() : void
  +teams : List<Team>
  +GetTeam(id : int) : Team
  +RegisterHero(hero : HeroController) : void
  +UnregisterHero(hero : HeroController) : void
  +RegisterCastle(castle : Castle) : void
  +UnregisterCastle(castle : Castle) : void
  +RegisterMine(mine : Mine) : void
  +UnregisterMine(mine : Mine) : void
}
class LR3PolymorphismDemo {
  +hero : HeroController
  +objects : List<MapObject>
  +RunDemo() : void
}
class GridStat {
  +castle : Castle
}
class HeroStats
class HeroInventory
class HeroArmy <<existing component>>

MapObject <|-- ResourceObject
MapObject <|-- NeutralArmy
MapObject <|-- TeamOwnedObject
TeamOwnedObject <|-- Castle
TeamOwnedObject <|-- Mine
MapObject ..> HeroController : Interact(hero)
HeroController ..> MapObject : mapObject.Interact(this)
LR3PolymorphismDemo --> "0..*" MapObject : objects (base type)
LR3PolymorphismDemo ..> HeroController : hero argument
TeamManager --> "0..*" Team : teams / registration
Team "0..1" o-- "0..*" HeroController : heroes
Team "0..1" o-- "0..*" Castle : castles
Team "0..1" o-- "0..*" Mine : mines
HeroController *-- HeroStats : stats
HeroController *-- HeroInventory : inventory
HeroController --> HeroArmy : existing army reference
GridStat --> "0..1" Castle : entrance link
Castle --> GridStat : entrance
Castle ..> TeamManager : RegisterCastle / UnregisterCastle
Mine ..> TeamManager : RegisterMine / UnregisterMine
ResourceObject ..> TeamManager : GetTeam / add gold

note right of MapObject
  Abstract contract; TeamOwnedObject inherits it.
  Four concrete classes override Interact(hero).
  Dispatch uses the runtime object type.
end note
note bottom of LR3PolymorphismDemo
  ContextMenu only, in Play Mode:
  foreach (MapObject obj in objects)
      obj.Interact(hero);
  Uses real effects; run in a separate test scene.
end note
note bottom of NeutralArmy
  Safe encounter message only.
  No overworld-to-battle handoff exists yet.
end note
note bottom of HeroController
  Resolve castle entrance first, then child MapObject.
  Call Interact once through the MapObject reference.
end note
@enduml
